WEBVTT

00:06:28.356 --> 00:06:31.323
And because they were able
to actually show where they stood,

00:06:31.347 --> 00:06:32.634
they broke an impasse.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.733
Architecture won.

00:06:35.479 --> 00:06:36.922
So that's work.

00:06:36.946 --> 00:06:42.127
What about a hypothetical
tense Thanksgiving dinner?

00:06:42.151 --> 00:06:43.384
Anyone?

00:06:43.408 --> 00:06:45.079
(Laughter)

00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:48.573
So first, ask the purpose.

00:06:48.597 --> 00:06:51.797
What does this family need this year?

00:06:52.594 --> 00:06:55.610
If cultivating good heat is part of it,

00:06:55.634 --> 00:07:00.545
then try for a night banning opinions
and asking for stories instead.